---

Provenance. This package is a rebrand of an existing DSH theme plugin, kept
under its original licence:

  - lib/client.tpl.js and scripts/gen-themes.mjs are derived from
    `@nonamelego/dsh-catppuccin` 0.5.0 (MIT), which in turn descends from
    Catppuccin (MIT, (c) 2021 Catppuccin) and from
    `zhijun-dai/Catppuccin-dsh-theme` (MIT). Its theme-registration machinery,
    persistence, settings row and glass/glow surfaces are reused as-is; the
    palette, theme ids, labels and the host routes are ours.
  - lib/index.js (the host half) was written here. Upstream's version queried
    the npm registry for its own published package; this plugin ships inside
    the app and is not published, so that route reports "not published"
    instead of inventing an update.
  - palette/eva.json, themes/eva-01.json and themes/eva-00.json are ours,
    generated by `npm run generate`.

The earlier dsh-dracula-theme (MIT, (c) ossFrankFrank) is credited because the
generated-file conventions and the `__ModuleLoader__` bundle shape in this repo
follow that plugin's structure.
